<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sigma raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sigma raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analysts Scott Wilkins and Marco Vera raised their rating for Mexico's Sigma Alimentos SA de CV Wednesday to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- In a report, they said they had raised the rating after talking with company executives. They added that Sigma's second-quarter results were expected to be very strong.</p>
<p>-- Sigma stock was unchanged in Mexico at 101 pesos.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
